<!-- question: II7_Q1_derivada_funcao_vetorial -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>II7_Q1_derivada_funcao_vetorial</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Como no Exemplo 10.1 do notebook, seja <strong>r</strong>(t) = (t&sup2;, 3t, ln(t+1)). Calculando <strong>r</strong>'(t) com SymPy e avaliando em t = 1, qual é o vetor <strong>r</strong>'(1) obtido?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(2, 3, 1/2)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(2, 3, 1)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(1, 3, 1/2)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(2, 3, 0)</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
  </question>

<!-- question: II7_Q2_integral_definida_componente -->
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>II7_Q2_integral_definida_componente</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>Como no Exemplo 10.2 do notebook, seja <strong>r</strong>(t) = (3t&sup2;, sen t, e<sup>2t</sup>). Calculando &int;<sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup> <strong>r</strong>(t) dt com SymPy, qual é o valor aproximado (4 casas decimais) da <strong>terceira</strong> componente do vetor resultante?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>3,1945</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>1,0000</p>]]></text>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>0,4597</p>]]></text>
